---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const effectiveDate = 'September 24, 2026';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Use" description="Terms of use for the Vernacular Labs website and research studies.">
  <section class="container-site pt-14 md:pt-20 pb-6">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Terms of Use</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,4rem)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] max-w-4xl">
      Terms for our site and studies.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-[14px] text-ash">Effective {effectiveDate}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container-site">
    <article class="legal">
      <p>
        These terms apply to your use of this website and to taking part in a Vernacular Labs
        research study. By using the site or booking an interview, you agree to them.
      </p>

      <h2 id="who-we-are">Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Vernacular Labs LLC (&ldquo;Vernacular Labs&rdquo;) is a research organization that conducts
        opinion research through one-on-one phone interviews. You can reach us at
        <a href="mailto:info@vernacularlabs.ai">info@vernacularlabs.ai</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 id="scheduling">Scheduling is by invitation only</h2>
      <p>
        Our scheduling pages are for booking research interviews with people we have invited.
        Please don&rsquo;t share your personal scheduling link with anyone else.
      </p>

      <h2 id="participation">Taking part is voluntary</h2>
      <p>
        You choose whether to take part, and you can stop the interview
        at any time. You can also cancel or change your booking from your confirmation text.
      </p>

      <h2 id="honorarium">Your honorarium</h2>
      <p>
        The $50 honorarium is a thank-you for taking part. It is sent by text message to the
        phone number on your booking, in two parts: $10 shortly after the call starts, and $40
        when the interview is done. The $40 usually arrives within minutes; if we need to manually
        verify the interview, it can take a day or two.
      </p>

      <h2 id="privacy">Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> explains what information we collect and how we use
        it, including the text messages we send about your call.
      </p>

      <h2 id="no-warranties">No warranties</h2>
      <p>
        We work to keep this site available and accurate, but we provide it &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and
        can&rsquo;t promise it will always be available or free of errors.
      </p>

      <h2 id="changes">Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        If we change these terms, we will post the new version on this page and update the
        effective date above.
      </p>

      <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions? Email <a href="mailto:info@vernacularlabs.ai">info@vernacularlabs.ai</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Layout>
